<p class="status"><b>Status:</b> this describes how we will review. Hands-on testing has not been completed for any tool yet, so no tool is scored.</p>

<h2 id="stages">Four stages</h2>
<ol>
<li><strong>Research.</strong> We collect each vendor’s published features, pricing, clearances and privacy terms, and note which claims are the vendor’s own.</li>
<li><strong>Hands-on testing.</strong> We use the tool on realistic clinical scenarios, never on real patient data.</li>
<li><strong>Privacy and safety check.</strong> We check data handling against HIPAA, UK GDPR, Canadian provincial law and the Australian Privacy Act, and ask for regulatory clearances where they apply.</li>
<li><strong>Physician review.</strong> Dr. Ravi Shankar Gupta reviews the draft and verdict before publication.</li>
</ol>

<h2 id="scores">Scores</h2>
<p>Scores are out of 10 and are only given after hands-on testing and physician review. A tool that has not completed all four stages is labelled “Researched” and is not ranked.</p>

<h2 id="updates">Updates</h2>
<p>Prices and features change often. Each page shows the date it was last checked, and we re-check on a regular schedule.</p>
